  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "include-base-44",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tINCLUDE-base (44 languages)\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Description\n\t\n\n\n\nPaper: http://arxiv.org/abs/2411.19799\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Summary\n\t\n\nINCLUDE is a comprehensive knowledge- and reasoning-centric benchmark across 44 languages that evaluates multilingual LLMs for performance in the actual language environments where they would be deployed. \nIt contains 22,637 4-option multiple-choice-questions (MCQ) extracted from academic and professional exams, covering 57 topics, including\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/CohereLabs/include-base-44.",
